  "tips": [
    {
      "id": "kpk1-l17-c4-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l17-c4-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dla ciebie, dla niego"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "After *dla* (for), *do* (to) and other little words, *go* and *jej* get an *n*: *prezent dla niego*, *dla niej*, *idę do niego*. *Ty* becomes *ciebie*: *to dla ciebie*. When you stress a person, use the long forms: *jemu nie dam nic* (to him I'll give nothing), *kocham tylko ciebie* (I love only you), *tobie dam prezent*."
      }
    }
  ],
